# Task 148-028 Execution Plan — ADR-041 Draft

## Approach

This task does NOT write TypeScript source code. It directly:
1. Inserts ADR-041 into `.brain/memory.db` via a Node.js script using MemoryStore API
2. Regenerates `.brain/exports/decisions.md` from the updated DB

## Steps

1. Write heartbeat (.tasks/task-148-028.hb) — already exists from Docker worker
2. Understand MemoryStore.insert() signature (DONE — read memory-store.ts)
3. Understand exportDecisionsMd() (DONE — reads from store.getByType('adr'))
4. Write a small Node.js script to:
   a. Open .brain/memory.db via MemoryStore
   b. Insert ADR-041 with status='proposed', tags=[governance, agent-pool, taxonomy, beta-ga], decay_exempt=true
   c. Call exportDecisionsMd(store) and write result to .brain/exports/decisions.md
5. Execute the script
6. Verify: query back adr-041, check decisions.md contains it
7. Write result file

## Files Changed
- .brain/memory.db (insert via MemoryStore API)
- .brain/exports/decisions.md (regenerated)

